To install: the installer opens with the desktop. If it does not:
    synapseos-installer

No desktop?  synapseos-plasma      starts Plasma and logs it
             synapseos-logs        collects everything into one file
             journalctl -b -p err  errors from this boot

No menu/window blur? The session is on software composition. Enable 3D
in the VM (VMSVGA) and reboot the normal Live entry — not "safe graphics".
Desktop fails in a VM? Reboot and pick "safe graphics" (no blur), or:
    sudo synapseos-safe-graphics on     # then log out and back in

Logs:  desktop    ~/.cache/synapseos/plasma-session.log
       installer  ~/.cache/calamares/session.log
